08503526", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75392232_479064611836859_364337361855434877_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eq6WWb0z-WIQ7kNvwENTf4a&_nc_oc=Adl5cQqjGxvnC7Y03pCp60jqeCb3Lq-96pt2m-d32xeaqRR6EkmPmmLsEyQL2JreeSk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftliNSl3EZU4GewgB1sZLo6sOX-VaxaDUIWYmSYiZRJHg&oe=699EE79D"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_Jchv8qDR3W.png", "id": "4060058590882627", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982690_4060058594215960_1778929180050044750_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dC84h49AW9gQ7kNvwHoWKP6&_nc_oc=AdnD9nmKux96cCJZEFR2E9eUzmJzsLTYTNS9YdXeXGiE2fK58b_H11_f7i6Wli6-eyI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvqdHkpK3P8HJITnink9SvMtiJEMVuJsJ1Wupue0coBDg&oe=699EDBB0"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_YaYzqSDxem.png", "id": "9389094021120160", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974860_9389094024453493_6010834170972518892_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oNywWs-3SisQ7kNvwEKPVy_&_nc_oc=AdmAAFjdbTkga6cfa5mQZa0O7ZFxMY4ec_QbgUC-M4zK4lVwGqvQ3DNsFI_kJr_VdSY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvHuk5vOZFtiYLzCUxOW9On1vxQJiyUZzJ80qr8t5njfw&oe=699EFC51"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Digestion Absorption_Landscape.png", "id": "760990872558213", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572923_760990875891546_6049348127562738334_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Chh_XKf31jQQ7kNvwGDwEm_&_nc_oc=Adnvz9nl5CQ-vVkpeah4KJ-HQZH0Pv9YVX3Y5_0O1Jx0tOFWyRYKrQlMa8jZhfLONVg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuhrGmkYs4cH1nGnmNBEDSdBrEdaduGB06iHUwVpBQ6lw&oe=699F02B6"}, "display_name": "Digestion Absorption Experiment - ContentsDa Science Experiment", "keywords": ["experiment", "biology", "digestion", "science", "contentsda"], "long_description": "1. Crush Extinguishing Agent A into a membrane in a mortar and pestle.\n2. Add Extinguishing Agent A to 20 ml of distilled water and stir with a glass rod.\n3. Crush Extinguishing Agent B in a mortar and pestle.\n4. Add Extinguishing Agent B to 20 ml of distilled water and stir with a glass rod.\n5. add 3 ml of 1% starch solution to the first horizontal row of the test paper in three 9-plate grooves.\n6. add 3 ml of 1% albumin solution to the second horizontal row in three 9-groove rows.\n7. in the first row, add 3 ml of iodine-potassium iodide solution in three 9-groove rows.\n8. add 3 ml of burette solution to the second horizontal row in three 9-groove rows.\n9. in the first vertical row, add 3 ml of distilled water into the three vertical rows of 9 plates.\n10. in the second vertical row, add 3 ml of Digestant A solution to each of the 3 vertical rows of 9 plates.\n11. in the third row, add 3 ml of Extinguishing Agent B solution into each of the three 9-groove rows.\n12. Increase the temperature of the room to 38\u00b0C.\n13. Observe what happens in the 9-plate groove\n\n<Results\nA contains a large amount of protease digestive enzyme, which breaks down proteins well.\nB contains a large amount of diastase enzyme, which breaks down carbohydrates.", "short_description": "Understand the journey of food in the body. Learn how digestive enzymes break down food and how nutrients are absorbed, an essential process for health and well-being."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "ge